  "summary": "V-STORM addresses fine-grained spatio-temporal video reasoning by providing a structure-aware framework for grounding evidence in spatio-temporal scenes, while LPAVR improves visual reasoning and speculative decoding through lookahead-guided evidence construction. Both approaches aim to bridge the gap between MLLMs and visual reasoning.",
